{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Ellentis",
    "steam_appid": 3586740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ellentis is a strategic card game set in a unique world of five elements. Simple rules hide a depth of gameplay, where every decision matters. Create combinations, manage your hand and maximize points by arranging cards in a circle on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Each card</u></strong> in the game has parameters such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color</strong> - red, yellow, green, blue, brown </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rank</strong> - 1, 2, 3, 4, 5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Material</strong> - Each of the 13 materials provides unique mechanics during the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Essence</strong> - The degree of essence of a card affects the score of the arrangement in the circle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circle mechanics</strong> - cards are placed in 5 slots in a circle on the board, and then all created arrangements are scored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slot upgrade mechanics</strong> - Each slot in the circle can be upgraded to provide an additional effect. Use this opportunity on your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Powers</strong> - You'll be able to use 3 special powers of your choice during the game, which you'll use at critical moments to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different deck types</strong> - Each deck is a new way to play the game to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievement System</strong> - For each achievement you earn in the game, you unlock new content: new decks, card materials, slot upgrades, and special powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong> - every game is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with combinations, plan your moves, and discover how far you can go in the world of <strong>Ellentis</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ellentis is a strategic card game set in a unique world of five elements. Simple rules hide a depth of gameplay, where every decision matters. Create combinations, manage your hand and maximize points by arranging cards in a circle on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Each card</u></strong> in the game has parameters such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color</strong> - red, yellow, green, blue, brown </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rank</strong> - 1, 2, 3, 4, 5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Material</strong> - Each of the 13 materials provides unique mechanics during the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Essence</strong> - The degree of essence of a card affects the score of the arrangement in the circle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circle mechanics</strong> - cards are placed in 5 slots in a circle on the board, and then all created arrangements are scored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slot upgrade mechanics</strong> - Each slot in the circle can be upgraded to provide an additional effect. Use this opportunity on your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Powers</strong> - You'll be able to use 3 special powers of your choice during the game, which you'll use at critical moments to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different deck types</strong> - Each deck is a new way to play the game to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievement System</strong> - For each achievement you earn in the game, you unlock new content: new decks, card materials, slot upgrades, and special powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong> - every game is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with combinations, plan your moves, and discover how far you can go in the world of <strong>Ellentis</strong>!</p>",
    "short_description": "Strategic card game set in a fantasy world. Create powerful combinations by combining elements and card levels in a unique circle system. Simple to learn, but full of depth - every decision matters. Master the mechanics, take risks and achieve the highest scores!",
